   "parameters": {
    "content": "## HL · Social inbox: Meta webhook (Lesson 5.5)\nOne webhook for Page feed comments, Messenger, and Instagram comments and messages.\n- GET: answer Meta's verification request once (hub.verify_token must match).\n- POST: check every event's X-Hub-Signature-256 (HMAC SHA-256 of the raw body with your app secret, as with Paystack in 2.5). Invalid -> 401, nothing processed.\nValid events are flattened into one shape and passed to SUB · Social inbox: handle.\n\nCredentials: none here (the secret check uses the Crypto node).\nPlaceholders: YOUR_META_VERIFY_TOKEN, YOUR_META_APP_SECRET, YOUR_HANDLE_WORKFLOW_ID.\nIn the Meta app, set the callback URL to https://YOUR_N8N_DOMAIN/webhook/hl-social-inbox and subscribe to feed, messages and Instagram comments. Use a test app and test Page first.",
    "height": 440,
    "width": 560
   },
